{"seq":2,"slug":"self-supervised-learning","title":"自监督学习","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/deep-learning/architectures-and-trends/self-supervised-learning","wordCount":1582,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"自监督学习\">自监督学习</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>自监督学习（Self-Supervised Learning, SSL）从无标注数据中自动构造监督信号来学习有用的特征表示。它的核心思想是设计前置任务（pretext task），让模型通过解决这些任务来学习数据的内在结构和语义，然后将学到的表示迁移到下游任务。自监督学习是大模型时代的基石——BERT 的掩码语言模型、GPT 的下一 token 预测、CLIP 的图文对比，都是自监督学习的成功应用。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[&quot;无标注数据&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;构造前置任务&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;预训练编码器&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; D[&quot;特征表示&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; E[&quot;微调/线性探测&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; F[&quot;下游任务&quot;]\">flowchart LR\n    A[\"无标注数据\"] --&gt; B[\"构造前置任务\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"预训练编码器\"]\n    C --&gt; D[\"特征表示\"]\n    D --&gt; E[\"微调/线性探测\"]\n    E --&gt; F[\"下游任务\"]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法类别</th>\n<th>前置任务</th>\n<th>代表方法</th>\n<th>适用模态</th>\n<th>关键技术</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>对比学习</td>\n<td>正负样本对比</td>\n<td>SimCLR, MoCo</td>\n<td>视觉</td>\n<td>数据增强、温度系数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>掩码预测</td>\n<td>预测被遮挡部分</td>\n<td>BERT, MAE</td>\n<td>视觉/语言</td>\n<td>掩码策略、解码器</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>无负样本</td>\n<td>特征对齐</td>\n<td>BYOL, DINO</td>\n<td>视觉</td>\n<td>动量编码器、停止梯度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>图文对比</td>\n<td>跨模态对齐</td>\n<td>CLIP</td>\n<td>多模态</td>\n<td>对比损失、大规模数据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自回归预测</td>\n<td>预测下一个</td>\n<td>GPT</td>\n<td>语言</td>\n<td>因果掩码</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"对比学习\">对比学习</h2><p>对比学习的核心思想是：同一样本的不同增强视图（正样本对）在特征空间中应该接近，不同样本的视图（负样本对）应该远离。</p>\n<p>SimCLR 的训练过程：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>对每个图像应用两种随机数据增强，得到两个视图</li>\n<li>通过共享编码器提取特征</li>\n<li>通过投影头映射到低维空间</li>\n<li>使用 NT-Xent 损失（归一化温度缩放交叉熵）训练</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import torch&#10;import torch.nn as nn&#10;import torch.nn.functional as F&#10;&#10;class SimCLR(nn.Module):&#10;    def __init__(self, encoder, projection_dim=128, temperature=0.5):&#10;        super().__init__()&#10;        self.encoder = encoder&#10;        self.projector = nn.Sequential(&#10;            nn.Linear(encoder.output_dim, 512),&#10;            nn.ReLU(),&#10;            nn.Linear(512, projection_dim),&#10;        )&#10;        self.temperature = temperature&#10;&#10;    def forward(self, x1, x2):&#10;        z1 = F.normalize(self.projector(self.encoder(x1)), dim=1)&#10;        z2 = F.normalize(self.projector(self.encoder(x2)), dim=1)&#10;        return z1, z2&#10;&#10;    def nt_xent_loss(self, z1, z2):&#10;        batch_size = z1.size(0)&#10;        z = torch.cat([z1, z2], dim=0)&#10;        sim = torch.mm(z, z.T) / self.temperature&#10;        mask = torch.eye(2 * batch_size, device=z.device).bool()&#10;        sim.masked_fill_(mask, float(&#39;-inf&#39;))&#10;        labels = torch.cat([&#10;            torch.arange(batch_size, 2 * batch_size),&#10;            torch.arange(batch_size)&#10;        ]).to(z.device)&#10;        return F.cross_entropy(sim, labels)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.nn </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nn</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.nn.functional </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> F</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> SimCLR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">nn</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Module</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> __init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, encoder, projection_dim</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">128</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, temperature</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        super</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">__init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.encoder </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> encoder</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.projector </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nn.Sequential(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            nn.Linear(encoder.output_dim, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">512</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            nn.ReLU(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            nn.Linear(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">512</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, projection_dim),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.temperature </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> temperature</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> forward</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, x1, x2):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        z1 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> F.normalize(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.projector(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.encoder(x1)), </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">dim</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        z2 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> F.normalize(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.projector(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.encoder(x2)), </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">dim</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> z1, z2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> nt_xent_loss</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, z1, z2):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        batch_size </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> z1.size(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        z </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.cat([z1, z2], </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">dim</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        sim </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.mm(z, z.T) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.temperature</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        mask </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.eye(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> batch_size, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">device</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">z.device).bool()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        sim.masked_fill_(mask, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">float</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'-inf'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        labels </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.cat([</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            torch.arange(batch_size, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> batch_size),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            torch.arange(batch_size)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        ]).to(z.device)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> F.cross_entropy(sim, labels)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>MoCo（Momentum Contrast）通过动量编码器和负样本队列解决了 SimCLR 依赖大 batch size 的问题。动量编码器的参数通过指数移动平均更新：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>θ</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><msub><mi>θ</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><msub><mi>θ</mi><mi>q</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta_k = m\\theta_k + (1-m)\\theta_q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    subgraph 对比学习框架&#10;        X[&quot;输入图像&quot;] --&gt; A1[&quot;增强视图 1&quot;]&#10;        X --&gt; A2[&quot;增强视图 2&quot;]&#10;        A1 --&gt; E1[&quot;查询编码器 f_q&quot;]&#10;        A2 --&gt; E2[&quot;键编码器 f_k&lt;br/&gt;(动量更新)&quot;]&#10;        E1 --&gt; Z1[&quot;查询特征 q&quot;]&#10;        E2 --&gt; Z2[&quot;键特征 k&quot;]&#10;        Z1 --&gt; LOSS[&quot;对比损失&lt;br/&gt;InfoNCE&quot;]&#10;        Z2 --&gt; LOSS&#10;    end\">flowchart TD\n    subgraph 对比学习框架\n        X[\"输入图像\"] --&gt; A1[\"增强视图 1\"]\n        X --&gt; A2[\"增强视图 2\"]\n        A1 --&gt; E1[\"查询编码器 f_q\"]\n        A2 --&gt; E2[\"键编码器 f_k&lt;br/&gt;(动量更新)\"]\n        E1 --&gt; Z1[\"查询特征 q\"]\n        E2 --&gt; Z2[\"键特征 k\"]\n        Z1 --&gt; LOSS[\"对比损失&lt;br/&gt;InfoNCE\"]\n        Z2 --&gt; LOSS\n    end</pre><h2 id=\"掩码预测范式\">掩码预测范式</h2><p>掩码预测让模型通过预测被遮挡的部分来学习数据的内在结构。在语言领域，BERT 随机遮挡 15% 的 token 并预测它们。在视觉领域，MAE（Masked Autoencoder）遮挡 75% 的图像 patch 并用轻量级解码器重建。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"class MAE(nn.Module):&#10;    def __init__(self, encoder, decoder, mask_ratio=0.75):&#10;        super().__init__()&#10;        self.encoder = encoder&#10;        self.decoder = decoder&#10;        self.mask_ratio = mask_ratio&#10;&#10;    def random_masking(self, x, mask_ratio):&#10;        N, L, D = x.shape&#10;        len_keep = int(L * (1 - mask_ratio))&#10;        noise = torch.rand(N, L, device=x.device)&#10;        ids_shuffle = torch.argsort(noise, dim=1)&#10;        ids_restore = torch.argsort(ids_shuffle, dim=1)&#10;        ids_keep = ids_shuffle[:, :len_keep]&#10;        x_masked = torch.gather(x, 1, ids_keep.unsqueeze(-1).expand(-1, -1, D))&#10;        return x_masked, ids_restore&#10;&#10;    def forward(self, imgs):&#10;        patches = self.encoder.patch_embed(imgs)&#10;        x_masked, ids_restore = self.random_masking(patches, self.mask_ratio)&#10;        latent = self.encoder(x_masked)&#10;        pred = self.decoder(latent, ids_restore)&#10;        return pred\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> MAE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">nn</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Module</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> __init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, encoder, decoder, mask_ratio</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.75</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        super</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">__init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.encoder </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> encoder</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.decoder </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> decoder</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.mask_ratio </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> mask_ratio</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> random_masking</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, x, mask_ratio):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        N, L, D </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> x.shape</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        len_keep </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(L </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> mask_ratio))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        noise </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.rand(N, L, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">device</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">x.device)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        ids_shuffle </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.argsort(noise, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">dim</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        ids_restore </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.argsort(ids_shuffle, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">dim</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        ids_keep </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ids_shuffle[:, :len_keep]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        x_masked </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.gather(x, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, ids_keep.unsqueeze(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).expand(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, D))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> x_masked, ids_restore</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> forward</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, imgs):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        patches </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.encoder.patch_embed(imgs)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        x_masked, ids_restore </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.random_masking(patches, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.mask_ratio)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        latent </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.encoder(x_masked)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        pred </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.decoder(latent, ids_restore)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pred</span></span></code></pre></div><p>MAE 的高掩码比率（75%）使得编码器只需处理 25% 的 patch，训练效率极高。同时，重建大面积缺失迫使模型学习高层语义特征而非简单的像素插值。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>掩码方法</th>\n<th>模态</th>\n<th>掩码比率</th>\n<th>重建目标</th>\n<th>编码器效率</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>BERT</td>\n<td>文本</td>\n<td>15%</td>\n<td>Token ID</td>\n<td>处理全部</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>MAE</td>\n<td>图像</td>\n<td>75%</td>\n<td>像素值</td>\n<td>仅处理可见</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>BEiT</td>\n<td>图像</td>\n<td>40%</td>\n<td>Visual Token</td>\n<td>处理全部</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>data2vec</td>\n<td>多模态</td>\n<td>可变</td>\n<td>编码器输出</td>\n<td>处理全部</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"无负样本方法\">无负样本方法</h2><p>BYOL（Bootstrap Your Own Latent）和 DINO 证明了不需要负样本也能学到好的表示，只需两个网络——在线网络和目标网络（动量更新）——之间相互预测。</p>\n<p>DINO 将 ViT 与自蒸馏结合：学生网络学习预测教师网络（动量更新）的输出分布。教师网络使用 centering 和 sharpening 防止模式坍塌。DINO 学到的特征具有令人惊讶的属性——注意力图自动关注物体的语义区域，无需任何分割标注。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"class DINO(nn.Module):&#10;    def __init__(self, student, teacher, center_momentum=0.9):&#10;        super().__init__()&#10;        self.student = student&#10;        self.teacher = teacher&#10;        self.center = torch.zeros(1, student.output_dim)&#10;        self.center_momentum = center_momentum&#10;&#10;    def forward(self, student_views, teacher_views):&#10;        student_out = [self.student(v) for v in student_views]&#10;        with torch.no_grad():&#10;            teacher_out = [self.teacher(v) for v in teacher_views]&#10;            teacher_out = [(t - self.center) for t in teacher_out]&#10;        loss = self.dino_loss(student_out, teacher_out)&#10;        self.update_center(teacher_out)&#10;        return loss\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> DINO</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">nn</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Module</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> __init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, student, teacher, center_momentum</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.9</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        super</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">__init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.student </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> student</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.teacher </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> teacher</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.center </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.zeros(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, student.output_dim)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.center_momentum </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> center_momentum</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> forward</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, student_views, teacher_views):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        student_out </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.student(v) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> v </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> student_views]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.no_grad():</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            teacher_out </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.teacher(v) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> v </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> teacher_views]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            teacher_out </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [(t </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.center) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> t </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> teacher_out]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        loss </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.dino_loss(student_out, teacher_out)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.update_center(teacher_out)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> loss</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"2025-进展-从-clip-正典到-dinov3-与-siglip-2\">2025 进展：从 CLIP 正典到 DINOv3 与 SigLIP 2</h2><p>上文的方法论（对比、掩码、自蒸馏）至今仍是教材骨架，但 2024-2025 年的重心已从「设计前置任务」转向「直接产出可复用的通用编码器」。两条主线值得单独记录：</p>\n<p><strong>DINO 系列的规模化（Meta AI）。</strong> DINOv2（Oquab et al., arXiv:2304.07193, 2023）用自动筛选的数据管线（LVD-142M）把自蒸馏推到工业可用，特征免微调即可服务分类、分割、深度估计。据 Meta 2025 年 8 月发布公告与论文 arXiv:2508.10104，DINOv3 将数据扩到约 17 亿图像量级（LVD-1689B）、模型最大至 7B 参数 ViT，并以 <strong>Gram anchoring</strong> 训练目标抑制长周期训练中 patch 级密集特征的退化，使同一编码器同时保持「分类级全局语义」与「像素级局部结构」，显著降低对下游任务微调的依赖（具体指标以其官方文档为准）。</p>\n<p><strong>SigLIP 2 的目标函数组合（Google DeepMind）。</strong> SigLIP（Zhai et al., ICCV 2023）曾用 sigmoid 损失替代 CLIP 的 softmax InfoNCE，免除对全局批内归一化的依赖；SigLIP 2（Tschannen et al., arXiv:2502.14786, 2025 年 2 月）在 sigmoid 对比损失之上追加三类辅助目标——定位感知的 captioning 损失、自蒸馏损失与掩码预测损失——并引入 NaFlex 变体支持原生长宽比与多分辨率输入。其编码器已成为众多开源多模态 LLM 视觉前端的主流选择之一。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>编码器</th>\n<th>时间锚点</th>\n<th>核心变化</th>\n<th>定位演进</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>CLIP</td>\n<td>2021</td>\n<td>图文双塔 + InfoNCE 对比</td>\n<td>零样本分类 / 多模态对齐基线</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>MAE</td>\n<td>2022</td>\n<td>高掩码率像素重建</td>\n<td>密集特征预训练</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DINOv2</td>\n<td>2023（arXiv:2304.07193）</td>\n<td>自动化数据管线 + 自蒸馏规模化</td>\n<td>免微调通用视觉特征</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SigLIP</td>\n<td>2023（ICCV）</td>\n<td>sigmoid 损失替代 softmax 对比</td>\n<td>更稳的图文对齐</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DINOv3</td>\n<td>2025.08（arXiv:2508.10104）</td>\n<td>Gram anchoring 保密集特征、Web 级数据</td>\n<td>分类+密集一体的高分辨率编码器</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SigLIP 2</td>\n<td>2025.02（arXiv:2502.14786）</td>\n<td>+captioning/自蒸馏/掩码预测、NaFlex</td>\n<td>多模态 LLM 视觉前端主流选择</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>趋势判断：视觉 SSL 与图文对齐两条线正在合流为「基础编码器」赛道——评价标准从线性探测精度转向密集任务免训练表现与多模态组合能力；前置任务设计的学术争论让位于「数据规模 × 目标函数组合 × 密集特征保持」的系统工程。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((自监督学习))&#10;    对比学习&#10;      SimCLR&#10;      MoCo&#10;      正负样本对&#10;    掩码预测&#10;      BERT&#10;      MAE&#10;      高掩码率&#10;    无负样本&#10;      BYOL&#10;      DINO&#10;      动量蒸馏&#10;    多模态&#10;      CLIP&#10;      图文对比&#10;    2025 进展&#10;      DINOv3 Gram anchoring&#10;      SigLIP 2 多目标组合&#10;      基础编码器赛道\">mindmap\n  root((自监督学习))\n    对比学习\n      SimCLR\n      MoCo\n      正负样本对\n    掩码预测\n      BERT\n      MAE\n      高掩码率\n    无负样本\n      BYOL\n      DINO\n      动量蒸馏\n    多模态\n      CLIP\n      图文对比\n    2025 进展\n      DINOv3 Gram anchoring\n      SigLIP 2 多目标组合\n      基础编码器赛道</pre><ul>\n<li>自监督学习从无标注数据构造监督信号，是大模型预训练的核心范式</li>\n<li>对比学习通过正负样本对比拉近/推远特征表示，SimCLR 和 MoCo 是经典方法</li>\n<li>MAE 通过 75% 高掩码率高效训练视觉编码器，迫使模型学习语义特征</li>\n<li>BYOL 和 DINO 证明无需负样本也能学到高质量表示</li>\n<li>自监督预训练 + 下游微调已成为计算机视觉和 NLP 的标准范式</li>\n<li>2025 年的重心是通用编码器：DINOv3 以 Gram anchoring 兼顾全局与密集特征，SigLIP 2 用多目标组合成为多模态 LLM 的主流视觉前端</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"自监督学习","id":"自监督学习"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"对比学习","id":"对比学习"},{"level":2,"text":"掩码预测范式","id":"掩码预测范式"},{"level":2,"text":"无负样本方法","id":"无负样本方法"},{"level":2,"text":"2025 进展：从 CLIP 正典到 DINOv3 与 SigLIP 2","id":"2025-进展-从-clip-正典到-dinov3-与-siglip-2"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"生成式架构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/deep-learning/architectures-and-trends/generative-architectures"},"next":{"title":"神经架构搜索","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/deep-learning/architectures-and-trends/neural-architecture-search"}}